 of 13 gangsters  already killed back in the 50s  whose bodies were buried in a chemical  dump before a gamma bomb fused them  together and brought them all back to  life  where do all these guys come from  spider-man promises to stop digger  but like a true mobster racist has raped  to twelve thousand dollars a day  before long digger reveals himself but  the gamma radiation that melded all the  corpses together begins to wear out  until he quite literally falls to pieces  in a battle with spider-man after the  job is finished spider-man hands over a  tape full of evidence to the nypd  ferrelli is arrested and parker in one  admittedly decent act of redemption  uses the money to open a library funny  how things work out isn't it  most spider-man fans would like to  forget the sins past storyline in which  peter parker learns that before her  death his girlfriend gwen stacy  gave birth to the twin children of his  number one nemesis  norman osborne many spider-man fans  actually have forgotten the follow-up  plotline since remembered which sees  spidey travelling to france  and teaming up with gwen's daughter  sarah who as it turns out  totally has the hots for him this is  creepy for a whole bunch of reasons  to start with sarah looks almost exactly  like gwen  and parker's resulting confusion implies  that he was more attracted to gwen's  looks than her personality  secondly sarah is actually younger than  10 years old  she just ages faster than normal thanks  to the green goblin serum coursing  through her blood so she's not an adult  even if she looks like one finally sarah  and her brother gabriel  grew up believing that peter parker was  their father thanks to norman who wanted  to turn the twins against spider-man  but that doesn't stop this from  happening unfortunately  no one's really in the right ear sarah  spends most of their adventure flirting  with parker and he doesn't exactly tell  her to back off either  still at the very least you could put  sarah